  storyText: "Just Another Night\n\nYou are in a bar in Kabuki, Watson. Nothing special, just a popular place on the streets of Night City, 2077. Neon buzzes, a jukebox plays samurai-era rock, two guys argue about a braindance.\n\nYou feel bored. Do you want to buy a drink?\n\nYou have 20 eb.\n\n1. Buy a drink (-5 eb)\n2. Nah"
